  "term": "spirit photography",
  "definition": "Spirit photography is a spiritualist mediumistic claim that photographs can show spirit figures near living people, especially as forms thought to belong to deceased relatives. In this historical source, it is presented as one of several reported séance phenomena rather than as a scientifically supported finding.",
